# Layout and spacing

Put urgent household information first, then routine monitoring. Use a predictable order: navigation, heading, a useful summary, primary controls, then supporting detail.

## Examples

These examples use invented household details. They are simulations: the buttons do not control a home. Open an example to see it at full width or to read its HTML.

